  "body": "Vendors Have Committed Elsewhere - All Offers Invited!\r\n\r\nPositioned in a private enclave on sought-after Rangitoto Terrace, this beautifully renovated home delivers the perfect balance of space, comfort, and flexibility for modern family living. \r\n\r\nDesigned with growing families and teenagers in mind, this substantial residence provides room for everyone to come together while still offering space to retreat and enjoy independence. With five generous bedrooms, two stylish bathrooms, a dedicated study, and multiple living areas, the home easily adapts to busy family life, working from home, entertaining, or accommodating extended family.\r\n\r\nFully renovated in 2023, all the hard work has been done. Simply move in and enjoy modern comfort, low-maintenance living, and true lock-and-leave convenience in one of Milford's most desirable locations.\r\n\r\nKey Features:\r\n* Multiple living areas for family flexibility\r\n* Double glazing throughout\r\n* Underfloor heating in downstairs bathroom\r\n* Gas heating and infinity hot water\r\n* Hard-wired WiFi throughout\r\n* Central vacuum system\r\n* High-stud ceilings with skylights creating light and space\r\n* Double internal-access garage with laundry area\r\n* Private balconies, deck and courtyard\r\n* Easy-care grounds with lock-and-leave appeal\r\n\r\nJust moments from Milford Beach, Lake Pupuke, and Milford Village, you'll enjoy easy access to boutique shopping, cafes, restaurants, and recreational amenities. The property is also zoned for Westlake Boys' and Girls' High Schools, Takapuna Normal Intermediate, and Milford School.\r\n\r\nLarge, fully renovated family homes in this premium location are rare. Offering exceptional space, modern convenience, fabulous neighbours, and outstanding value for money, this is an opportunity not to be missed!\r\n\r\nThe vendors are serious, all offers will be presented, and this home will be sold. Contact me today to arrange your viewing.\r\n\r\n* Please note that some internal photos have been digitally staged.\r\n* This property has not been affected by any flooding events.",
